+++ b/build-aux/livehime/pkg/welcome.html
@@ -0,0 +1,23 @@
+<!DOCTYPE html>
+<html lang="zh-CN">
+<head>
+<meta charset="utf-8">
+<style>
+  body { font: 13px -apple-system, "PingFang SC", sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: CanvasText; }
+  h2 { font-size: 15px; margin: 0 0 8px; }
+  p { margin: 0 0 10px; }
+  .en { color: GrayText; }
+</style>
+</head>
+<body>
+<h2>欢迎安装 LiveHime @VERSION@</h2>
+<p>LiveHime 是带“直播姬”面板的 OBS Studio：在 Mac 上登录哔哩哔哩、开播、看弹幕。</p>
+<p>一路点“继续”就好。安装器会自动选择适合这台 Mac 的版本（Apple 芯片或 Intel），
+装到“应用程序”文件夹，名字是 <b>LiveHimeMacApp</b>。已经装过的话会直接替换，登录、场景和设置都会保留。</p>
+<p>安装时会要求输入这台 Mac 的开机密码，这是 macOS 往“应用程序”里装软件的正常步骤。</p>
+<p class="en">Keep clicking Continue. The installer picks the build for this Mac (Apple silicon or Intel) and puts
+<b>LiveHimeMacApp</b> in Applications, replacing an earlier copy; your sign-in, scenes and settings stay.
+macOS asks for your login password to install into Applications.</p>
+<p class="en">LiveHime is a third-party community project, not an official product of Bilibili or the OBS Project.</p>
+</body>
+</html>
